{"id":66748,"date":"2025-09-06T13:48:21","date_gmt":"2025-09-06T12:48:21","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=66748"},"modified":"2026-10-16T21:13:26","modified_gmt":"2026-10-16T20:13:26","slug":"grande-premio-de-atletismo-de-ancede-baiao","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/grande-premio-de-atletismo-de-ancede-baiao\/","title":{"rendered":"27\u00ba Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Atletismo de Ancede \u2013 Bai\u00e3o \u2013 Prova da Bengala 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">27\u00ba Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Atletismo de Ancede \u2013 Bai\u00e3o \u2013 Prova da Bengala 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>27\u00ba Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Atletismo de Ancede \u2013 Bai\u00e3o \u2013 Prova da Bengala 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>15 de novembro de 2026<\/strong>, pelas <strong>10:00<\/strong>, na freguesia de <strong>Ancede<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Bai\u00e3o<\/strong> (distrito do Porto). Organizada pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva de Ancede<\/strong> e ajuizada pelo Conselho de Arbitragem da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo do Porto<\/strong>, esta emblem\u00e1tica prova de estrada \u00e9 carinhosamente conhecida no calend\u00e1rio nacional como a <strong>Prova da Bengala<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo integra duas vertentes com partida \u00e0s <strong>10:00<\/strong>: a competitiva <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> (aberta a atletas federados e n\u00e3o federados nos escal\u00f5es Seniores 18-34 anos e Veteranos 35 a 65+, com posto de abastecimento de \u00e1gua aos 5 km) e a <strong>Caminhada de 6 km<\/strong> de car\u00e1ter n\u00e3o competitivo (aberta a participantes a partir dos 12 anos, com abastecimento de \u00e1gua aos 3 km). Cumprindo a tradi\u00e7\u00e3o de Ancede, todos os atletas que concluam os <strong>10 km<\/strong> recebem na meta a t-shirt oficial, uma garrafa de vinho e a ic\u00f3nica bengala, enquanto os participantes da caminhada recebem uma t-shirt t\u00e9cnica.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A distribui\u00e7\u00e3o dos dorsais decorre na <strong>sede da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva de Ancede<\/strong> no s\u00e1bado, 14 de novembro de 2026, das 15h00 \u00e0s 19h00, e no domingo, dia da prova, a partir das 08h00 at\u00e9 meia hora antes da partida (09h30).<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">15 de Novembro de 2026 \u00e0s 10:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Ancede, Bai\u00e3o, Porto<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Corrida (10 km) e Caminhada (6 km)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva de Ancede<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.desportave.pt\/data\/_formacao\/220_Regulamento.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Abrir Regulamento Oficial (PDF) &rarr;<br \/>\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida de Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Atletismo de Ancede (10 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 15 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 5 de Outubro:<\/strong> 10,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (05\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">De 6 de Outubro a 11 de Novembro:<\/strong> 12,50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (11\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">No dia da prova (limite 20 vagas):<\/strong> 15,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (15\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada (6 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 15 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 13 de Novembro:<\/strong> 5,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (13\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data, a hora e o local do 27\u00ba Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Atletismo de Ancede \u2013 Bai\u00e3o 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se no domingo, 15 de novembro de 2026, pelas 10:00, em Ancede, no concelho de Bai\u00e3o (distrito do Porto), devendo os atletas apresentar-se no local de partida 15 minutos antes do in\u00edcio.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e os postos de abastecimento previstos no regulamento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento disp\u00f5e da Corrida Principal de 10 km (competitiva, com abastecimento de \u00e1gua aos 5 km) e da Caminhada de 6 km (n\u00e3o competitiva, aberta a maiores de 12 anos, com abastecimento de \u00e1gua aos 3 km).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e prazos de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Para a Corrida de 10 km (Seniores e Veteranos, federados e n\u00e3o federados), a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o custa 10,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 5 de outubro, 12,50 \u20ac de 6 de outubro a 11 de novembro, e 15,00 \u20ac no dia da prova (limitado a 20 inscri\u00e7\u00f5es). Para a Caminhada de 6 km, o valor \u00e9 de 5,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 13 de novembro.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A distribui\u00e7\u00e3o dos dorsais realiza-se na sede da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva de Ancede no s\u00e1bado, 14 de novembro, das 15:00 \u00e0s 19:00, e no domingo, dia da prova, das 08:00 \u00e0s 09:30 (at\u00e9 meia hora antes da partida).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que recebem os participantes \u00e0 chegada e quais s\u00e3o os pr\u00e9mios?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Todos os atletas que concluam os 10 km recebem \u00e0 chegada a t-shirt, uma garrafa de vinho e a tradicional bengala, enquanto os participantes da caminhada recebem t-shirt t\u00e9cnica. H\u00e1 trof\u00e9us para os 3 primeiros de cada escal\u00e3o (Seniores 18-34 e Vet 35, 40, 45, 50, 55, 60 e 65+), trof\u00e9us para as 3 primeiras equipas M\/F (5 melhores atletas), trof\u00e9u para a equipa mais numerosa nos 10 km e pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios\/utilit\u00e1rios.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza o 27\u00ba Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Atletismo de Ancede \u2013 Bai\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 organizada pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva de Ancede, com j\u00fari sob a responsabilidade do Conselho de Arbitragem da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo do Porto.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"27\u00ba Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Atletismo de Ancede \u2013 Bai\u00e3o \u2013 Prova da Bengala 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-15\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Ancede, Bai\u00e3o\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Bai\u00e3o\", \"addressRegion\": \"Porto\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva de Ancede\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data, a hora e o local do 27\u00ba Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Atletismo de Ancede \u2013 Bai\u00e3o 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se no domingo, 15 de novembro de 2026, pelas 10:00, em Ancede, no concelho de Bai\u00e3o (distrito do Porto), devendo os atletas apresentar-se no local de partida 15 minutos antes do in\u00edcio.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e os postos de abastecimento previstos no regulamento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento disp\u00f5e da Corrida Principal de 10 km (competitiva, com abastecimento de \u00e1gua aos 5 km) e da Caminhada de 6 km (n\u00e3o competitiva, aberta a maiores de 12 anos, com abastecimento de \u00e1gua aos 3 km).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e prazos de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Para a Corrida de 10 km (Seniores e Veteranos, federados e n\u00e3o federados), a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o custa 10,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 5 de outubro, 12,50 \u20ac de 6 de outubro a 11 de novembro, e 15,00 \u20ac no dia da prova (limitado a 20 inscri\u00e7\u00f5es). Para a Caminhada de 6 km, o valor \u00e9 de 5,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 13 de novembro.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e quando funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A distribui\u00e7\u00e3o dos dorsais realiza-se na sede da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva de Ancede no s\u00e1bado, 14 de novembro, das 15:00 \u00e0s 19:00, e no domingo, dia da prova, das 08:00 \u00e0s 09:30 (at\u00e9 meia hora antes da partida).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que recebem os participantes \u00e0 chegada e quais s\u00e3o os pr\u00e9mios?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Todos os atletas que concluam os 10 km recebem \u00e0 chegada a t-shirt, uma garrafa de vinho e a tradicional bengala, enquanto os participantes da caminhada recebem t-shirt t\u00e9cnica. H\u00e1 trof\u00e9us para os 3 primeiros de cada escal\u00e3o (Seniores 18-34 e Vet 35, 40, 45, 50, 55, 60 e 65+), trof\u00e9us para as 3 primeiras equipas M\/F (5 melhores atletas), trof\u00e9u para a equipa mais numerosa nos 10 km e pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios\/utilit\u00e1rios.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem organiza o 27\u00ba Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Atletismo de Ancede \u2013 Bai\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova \u00e9 organizada pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva de Ancede, com j\u00fari sob a responsabilidade do Conselho de Arbitragem da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo do Porto.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66749,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,28],"event_type_2":[24,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5"